    routePath: 'brag-5-card',
    LLM: 'Game: 5-Card Brag. Type: Vying. Rules: 5 dealt, 3 kept. Hierarchy: Prial > Running Flush > Run. High-strength variant of parent 3-card game.',
    Player: 'You were dealt a pair of 3s, an Ace, and two random cards. Keep the 3s and the Ace for a high-potential hand, then stay Blind to pressure your opponents!',
