        medium: 'Identifies pairs and runs in the initial 5 cards. Stays blind for 1 round.',
        hard: 'Optimizes the 3-card hand for long-term equity. Tracks mucked cards. Expert at blind bluffing.',
      },
      considerations: [
        'Requires a 5-choose-3 hand optimization algorithm.',
        'Betting logic must account for the high average hand strength.',
      ],
